---
description: Architecture Decision Record standards
globs:
  - "architecture-decisions/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use the ADR template in templates/adr-template.md.

Each ADR must document:
- context and problem
- decision drivers
- considered options
- chosen decision and rationale
- consequences (positive and negative)
- status and date

Number ADRs sequentially (ADR-0001, ADR-0002, ...).
